    "purpose": "One row-equivalent entry per manually curated experimental pattern with trusted expected phase and orientation metadata.",
    "how_to_edit": [
      "Copy this file to curated_cases.json and replace all example values with real values.",
      "Keep all keys unchanged unless the code is updated to support new keys.",
      "Use repo-relative paths like data/test/... (not absolute machine-specific paths).",
      "If a value is unknown, set null and explain in notes."
    ],
